user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-29T00:19:46Z","updated_at":"2026-08-29T00:19:46Z","body":"> Do you have access to a XR device for testing?\r\n\r\nYes, I can test on a Quest 3.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5459121118/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484663162","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122904#issuecomment-5484663162","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122904","id":5484663162,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRulReg","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T21:12:16Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T21:12:16Z","body":"> * Apply refresh rate only if the max FPS is on the list of supported refresh rates (or if the max FPS is an even divisor of one of the available refresh rates, for even frame pacing).\r\n\r\nThe documentation in https://developer.android.com/media/optimize/performance/frame-rate#no-change recommends to apply the refresh rate regardless to provide the platform with more information about the game's preferred refresh rate.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484663162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484714037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122904#issuecomment-5484714037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122904","id":5484714037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABRuoYNQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-31T21:16:28Z","updated_at":"2026-08-31T21:45:57Z","body":"> The documentation in [developer.android.com/media/optimize/performance/frame-rate#no-change](https://developer.android.com/media/optimize/performance/frame-rate#no-change) recommends to apply the refresh rate regardless to provide the platform with more information about the game's preferred refresh rate.\r\n\r\nOn paper, this would make sense, but if it causes the actual FPS to be lower than the max FPS project setting, it's undesired and will look like a bug to users.\r\n\r\nIdeally, Android would do this job of picking a good refresh rate for us according to the FPS value we pass to it, but it's not doing this well yet (or not on some vendors at least). In short, I'd expect it to behave as follows:\r\n\r\n- Loop over all refresh rates, and pick the refresh rate that matches the max FPS value *exactly* (with integer rounding).\r\n- If no refresh rate matches the chosen FPS value, do the same with the refresh rates divided by 2, then, 3 then 4 until a value matches.\r\n- If there's still no match, choose the highest possible refresh rate to ensure frame pacing is the \"least worst\" it can be (it won't be even, but slightly uneven is better than very uneven).\r\n\r\nThis is very similar to how the FPS limiter works on SteamOS.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5484714037/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5511226595","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122904#issuecomment-5511226595","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122904","id":5511226595,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSH6k4w","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-02T14:33:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T14:33:40Z","body":"@dsyze @ataryy4 @CryI3aby Could you test [these builds of this pull request](https://www.swisstransfer.com/dl/01a06288-4744-70d7-a18e-0812219b75ca) on affected devices? One APK is for OpenGL, the other is for Vulkan (they share the same app ID so they'll replace each other when installed).\r\n\r\nThese builds *should* use the maximum supported refresh rate on the device, please tell me if they don't. The builds below are valid for 15 days, but I can extend it to 30 days if needed.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5511226595/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5525110600","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122904#issuecomment-5525110600","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122904","id":5525110600,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSVJ_SA","user":{"login":"BrainBlasted","id":29347290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzQ3Mjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29347290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted","html_url":"https://github.com/BrainBlasted","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrainBlasted/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-03T11:36:27Z","updated_at":"2026-09-03T11:36:56Z","body":"Last night I tested both builds on my phone (OnePlus 12 running Android 16, 120Hz screen), and both capped out at 60Hz. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5525110600/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":